      <div class="area-rail"><p class="area-eyebrow">In short</p></div>
      <div class="area-body">
      <h2>Chayce Properties in one paragraph</h2>
      <p>Chayce Properties Ltd is a Northampton-based later-life moving and downsizing service founded in 2026. It helps older people, and the families who support them, move home anywhere in the UK. One dedicated coordinator manages the whole journey: sorting and decluttering, packing, a fully insured removal, estate agent and solicitor liaison, storage, and unpacking and settling in at the new home.</p>
      <p>Chayce Properties is not an estate agent and does not sell property. It is also not a standard removals firm: the removal is one step inside a managed move.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

