      <h2>Packages and prices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/discovery/">Discovery Consultation</a>: &pound;150, a one-hour personalised plan, timeline and budget.</li>
        <li><a href="/bronze-essentials/">Bronze Essentials</a>: from &pound;995, packing, insured removal, furniture reassembly and light cleaning.</li>
        <li><a href="/silver-comfort/">Silver Comfort</a>: from &pound;1,850, full-service move with a dedicated coordinator.</li>
        <li><a href="/gold-prestige/">Gold Prestige</a>: from &pound;3,250, adds solicitor coordination, home staging and up to six weeks of storage.</li>
        <li><a href="/platinum-bespoke/">Platinum Bespoke</a>: from &pound;6,500, bespoke relocation with a personal concierge and three months of post-move support.</li>
      </ul>
