<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="area-copy">
      <div class="area-rail"><p class="area-eyebrow">Comparison</p></div>
      <div class="area-body">
      <h2>How Chayce differs from a standard removals firm</h2>
      <p>A standard removals firm collects and delivers your belongings on one day. Chayce manages the lead-up and the aftermath as well: sorting, packing, liaison with your estate agent and solicitor, cleaning, storage and settling in, all through one coordinator, with the removal fully insured.</p>
      <p>If you only need a van and a crew, a standard removals firm will usually cost less. Chayce is for people who want the whole move handled.</p>
